  "description": "One API over the Agora Signaling SDK for Android and iOS: log in, subscribe to channels and publish/receive messages with awaitable calls and ordinary .NET events, instead of writing a per-platform adapter over Java result callbacks and Objective-C completion blocks. Pulls in the platform binding that matches whichever target framework you build. Works in .NET MAUI and plain .NET for Android / .NET for iOS apps alike — no MAUI-specific companion needed.",
